# Sample Video Generation Prompts for AI Story Harness
# One prompt per line. Lines starting with # are comments.

A poor student living in a modest town discovers an old computer and works tirelessly to become an accomplished software engineer.
A brave stray cat protects an ancient mountain village from a mysterious shadowy creature during a winter snowstorm.
An adventurous young astronomer detects an anomalous radio signal from a distant star system that changes human history.
A determined athlete recovers from a devastating injury through perseverance and rises to win the national championship.
A humble baker in a magical kingdom invents a secret pastry recipe that brings peace between rival royal families.
An aspiring marine biologist dives into an uncharted deep sea trench and discovers a luminous underwater civilization.
A reclusive clockmaker crafts a pocket watch that can replay lost memories, helping an old friend find closure.
A robotic explorer on Mars is separated from its crew during a dust storm and embarks on a solo journey across the red dunes.
